What:		/proc/sentry_remote_reporter/panic
Date:		March 2025
Contact:	Huawei Technologies Co., Ltd. <sxt1001@huawei.com>
Description:
		Enable or disable panic event reporting.

		Write Values:
			"on"  - Enable panic event reporting
			"off" - Disable panic event reporting

		Read Values:
			"on" or "off" - Current panic event reporting status

		Examples:
			# Enable panic event reporting
			echo "on" > /proc/sentry_remote_reporter/panic

			# Disable panic event reporting
			echo "off" > /proc/sentry_remote_reporter/panic

			# Check current status
			cat /proc/sentry_remote_reporter/panic
			on

		Notes:
		- Requires crash_kexec_post_notifiers to be enabled for activation

